@startuml Drools_Governance_Layer
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectanglePadding 12
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam linetype polyline
left to right direction


' =======================
' LEFT SIDE
' =======================

rectangle PIPE as "
DoDAF-SE Pipeline
(Stages 1–6)
"

rectangle ORCH as "
Orchestrator & Agents
- Stage Crews
- Tasks & Tools
"

PIPE --> ORCH

' =======================
' CENTER — DROOLS
' =======================

rectangle DROOLS as "
Drools Rules Engine
(Governance & Validation)
"

ORCH --> DROOLS
PIPE --> DROOLS

note bottom of DROOLS
Responsibilities:
- Fit-for-Purpose (F2P) gate
- Stage routing decisions
- Document type checks
- ICD structure validation
- OV/SV/SvcV/PV rules
- Red / Yellow / Green gates
end note

' =======================
' RIGHT — RULESETS & OUTCOME
' =======================

rectangle RULESETS as "
Governed Rule Sets

- F2P Gate Rules
- Stage Routing Logic
- Viewpoint Consistency
- Standards / Measures Checks
- Severity & Risk Thresholds
"

rectangle OUT as "
Decision Outcomes

- Run / Skip stages
- Warnings & alerts
- Validation messages
- Compliance flags
"

DROOLS --> RULESETS
DROOLS --> OUT

note top of OUT
Decisions returned to
orchestrator and pipeline
end note

@enduml